---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn about Wayne Sheppard and BAM Team Services LLC's journey in technology innovation">
	<section class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-blue-900 to-slate-900 py-20 md:py-32 overflow-hidden">
		<div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden">
			<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600/20 via-transparent to-emerald-600/20"></div>
			<div class="absolute top-20 left-1/4 w-2 h-2 bg-blue-400 rounded-full animate-pulse"></div>
			<div class="absolute bottom-32 right-1/3 w-3 h-3 bg-emerald-400 rounded-full animate-pulse" style="animation-delay: 1s;"></div>
		</div>
		<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
			<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-8 text-center">
				<span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-emerald-400">
					About BAM Team Services
				</span>
			</h1>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-slate-50">
		<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-slate-700">
				<div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-emerald-50 p-8 rounded-xl border border-blue-200 mb-12">
					<p class="text-xl mb-0 text-slate-800 leading-relaxed">
						BAM Team Services LLC is the brainchild of <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-emerald-600 font-semibold">Wayne Sheppard</span>, a visionary technology leader with over three decades of pioneering innovation in telecommunications, software development, and business transformation.
					</p>
				</div>

				<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900 to-slate-700 mt-12 mb-8">Wayne Sheppard: A Legacy of Innovation</h2>
				
				<div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-slate-200 mb-8">
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-blue-800 mb-4">Early Pioneering Years</h3>
					<p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
						In the late 1980s, Mr. Sheppard founded <span class="font-semibold text-blue-600">BMCI</span>, establishing himself as a leader in wireless security and regional mobile phone RCC technologies. He was among the first entrants to Computer Telephony Integration and IVR Service Bureau solutions, recognizing early the transformative potential of integrating telecommunications with computing.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-slate-200 mb-8">
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-emerald-800 mb-4">CONTACT, Inc.: Custom Solutions for Industry Leaders</h3>
				<p>
					Building on this foundation, Mr. Sheppard founded CONTACT, Inc., a boutique custom IVR development provider. Under his leadership, CONTACT delivered sophisticated voice response solutions to prestigious clients including:
				</p>
				<ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-4 mb-6">
					<li>Allstate Insurance</li>
					<li>Sun Life of Canada</li>
					<li>John Hancock Insurance</li>
					<li>Federal Express</li>
					<li>American Express</li>
				</ul>

				<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">SpeechCraft, Inc.: Voice Recognition Pioneer</h3>
				<p>
					Funded by an insurance industry group, SpeechCraft, Inc. represented another leap forward in 1994. The company introduced the industry's first voice recognition-based address change service, achieving a remarkable 95%+ successful transaction rate—a breakthrough achievement at the time.
				</p>

				<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">CTI Expertise and Enterprise Consulting</h3>
				<p>
					In 1996, Mr. Sheppard turned his full attention to the Computer Telephony Integration (CTI) space. His expertise became sought after by industry giants, with consulting clients including:
				</p>
				<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-6">
					<ul class="list-disc list-inside">
						<li>Genesys Telecommunications Labs</li>
						<li>Andersen Consulting</li>
						<li>Deloitte and Touche</li>
						<li>Sprint</li>
					</ul>
					<ul class="list-disc list-inside">
						<li>MCI</li>
						<li>Bank of America</li>
						<li>Charles Schwab</li>
						<li>And many others</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6">Today: Technology and Change for Good</h2>
				<p>
					BAM Team Services LLC represents the culmination of this extensive experience. With a current focus on "Technology and Change for Good," the company leverages Mr. Sheppard's deep expertise to guide organizations through digital transformation, strategic planning, and innovative problem-solving.
				</p>
				
				<p>
					As the Technology and Business Process Whisperer, BAM Team Services supports a portfolio of forward-thinking business units including acmemarketing.us, bemorefree.com, disendarkenment.com, healthcareactivist.org, and mindlooker.com—each dedicated to creating positive impact through technology and innovation.
				</p>

				<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-blue-900 to-slate-900 rounded-xl p-8 mt-12 text-center">
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-emerald-400 mb-4">Our Mission</h3>
					<p class="text-slate-300 italic text-lg leading-relaxed">
						To harness decades of technology leadership and innovation experience in service of meaningful change, helping organizations navigate complexity and achieve transformative growth.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>